Playing in wizard mode is a good way to learn about the monsters and the
magic that you'll come across.  To be able to use wizard mode, you must
compile the game with your login name in the line

# define WIZARD "mylogin"

which appears in one of the files refered to in the Install.unix file.

Then, start the game with

nethack -X

When playing in wizard mode there is a help screen that lists the
commands.  (Type '?'.)

The wish command (^W) is much more powerful than a wand of wishing, and
you can get items with very high + factors.  However, you don't need good
armor because you have the choice of whether you die when hp -> 0.

